    "result_text": "`AcceptanceTest` is the only test class, and it passes. The change is complete.\n\n## Summary\n\nThe spec required that creating an owner returns a `displayName` formatted as `'LastName, FirstName'` from the stored names. Two changes implemented it:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added a `readOnly` `displayName` property to the `Owner` schema, so the generated `OwnerDto` gains a `displayName` field returned by both the create (`POST /api/owners`) and read (`GET /api/owners/{id}`) endpoints.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 Added a MapStruct `@Mapping` on `toOwnerDto` that derives `displayName` as `owner.getLastName() + \", \" + owner.getFirstName()` from the stored entity names.\n\nBecause both responders route through `OwnerMapper.toOwnerDto`, the derived name appears consistently. `Tests run: 1, Failures: 0, Errors: 0` \u2014 the suite is green.",
